  "description": "Umbrella / meta package for the Honua .NET SDK. Installing this package brings in every other Honua.Sdk.* package and exposes a single AddHonua(o => o.BaseAddress = ...) DI registration that fans out across every enabled sub-package. Use the narrower per-package facades (Honua.Sdk.Grpc, Honua.Sdk.Admin, etc.) directly if you want to depend on less.",
